{
  "kind": "landflow/template",
  "version": 1,
  "template": {
    "name": "Work from Linear into the second brain",
    "description": "Issues, comments and project updates in Linear become work.bug_reported, work.feature_request, work.ticket_moved, work.release and work.self_update events, and a customer need or project keeps its customer or initiative in the second brain.",
    "categories": [
      "productivity",
      "data"
    ],
    "credentials": [
      {
        "id": "linear",
        "type": "linear.linearApi",
        "name": "Linear",
        "description": "A personal API key; registering the webhook needs a workspace admin’s key."
      }
    ],
    "setup": [
      "Pick or add the Linear credential: a workspace admin’s API key, since the trigger registers its own webhook when you publish.",
      "Pick a team in the trigger (empty: every public team) and the resources to follow.",
      "Customers come from the issue’s customer needs, else a label such as `customer:acme` (prefix in the trigger’s options).",
      "Declare the work kinds once with `pnpm brain:work-kinds` (or leave **Declare Kind If New** on in **Record work event**).",
      "Publish the workflow; the events show in **Insights**, the customers and initiatives in **What Landflow knows**."
    ],
    "dataTables": [],
    "workflow": {
      "id": "",
      "name": "Work from Linear into the second brain",
      "description": "Issues, comments and project updates in Linear become work.bug_reported, work.feature_request, work.ticket_moved, work.release and work.self_update events, and a customer need or project keeps its customer or initiative in the second brain.",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "trigger",
          "name": "Linear Trigger",
          "type": "linear.linearTrigger",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
            0,
            0
          ],
          "parameters": {
            "resourceTypes": [
              "Issue",
              "Comment",
              "ProjectUpdate"
            ]
          },
          "credentials": {
            "linearApi": {
              "id": "linear",
              "name": "Linear"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "record",
          "name": "Record work event",
          "type": "core.recordEvent",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
            260,
            -160
          ],
          "parameters": {
            "kind": "{{ $json.kind }}",
            "attributes": "{{ ({ source: $json.source, sourceId: $json.sourceId, url: $json.url, actor: $json.actorEmail, title: $json.title, summary: $json.summary, team: $json.teamHint, initiative: $json.initiativeHint, customer: $json.customerHint, occurredAt: $json.occurredAt }) }}",
            "declareIfNew": true,
            "message": "{{ $json.title }}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "hasCustomer",
          "name": "Names a customer?",
          "type": "core.if",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
            260,
            20
          ],
          "parameters": {
            "conditions": {
              "condition": [
                {
                  "left": "{{ $json.customerHint }}",
                  "operator": "isNotEmpty",
                  "right": ""
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "customer",
          "name": "Keep the customer",
          "type": "core.brainEntity",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
            520,
            20
          ],
          "parameters": {
            "operation": "upsert",
            "type": "customer",
            "entityId": "{{ String($json.customerHint).toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9_.-]+/g, '-').replace(/^-+|-+$/g, '').slice(0, 64) }}",
            "name": "{{ $json.customerHint }}",
            "attributes": "{{ ({ lastSource: $json.source, lastSeenAt: $json.occurredAt }) }}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "hasInitiative",
          "name": "Part of an initiative?",
          "type": "core.if",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
            260,
            200
          ],
          "parameters": {
            "conditions": {
              "condition": [
                {
                  "left": "{{ $json.initiativeHint }}",
                  "operator": "isNotEmpty",
                  "right": ""
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "initiative",
          "name": "Keep the initiative",
          "type": "core.brainEntity",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
            520,
            200
          ],
          "parameters": {
            "operation": "upsert",
            "type": "initiative",
            "entityId": "{{ String($json.initiativeHint).toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9_.-]+/g, '-').replace(/^-+|-+$/g, '').slice(0, 64) }}",
            "name": "{{ $json.initiativeHint }}",
            "attributes": "{{ ({ lastSource: $json.source, lastSeenAt: $json.occurredAt }) }}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "connections": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "main",
          "source": "trigger",
          "sourceIndex": 0,
          "target": "record",
          "targetIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "main",
          "source": "trigger",
          "sourceIndex": 0,
          "target": "hasCustomer",
          "targetIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "main",
          "source": "hasCustomer",
          "sourceIndex": 0,
          "target": "customer",
          "targetIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "main",
          "source": "trigger",
          "sourceIndex": 0,
          "target": "hasInitiative",
          "targetIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "c5",
          "type": "main",
          "source": "hasInitiative",
          "sourceIndex": 0,
          "target": "initiative",
          "targetIndex": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
